430
01:58:22,400 --> 01:58:24,760
So you mentioned something on homework,

431
01:58:24,760 --> 01:58:27,760
and then how it's something that you read, change that.

432
01:58:27,760 --> 01:58:32,360
See whether you can combine those two things.

433
01:58:32,360 --> 01:58:34,560
Now, important things to know about the exams.

434
01:58:34,560 --> 01:58:36,840
The exam is fully open book and notes.

435
01:58:39,920 --> 01:58:41,880
So you can bring any written materials

436
01:58:41,880 --> 01:58:45,280
that you want whatsoever without any limit.

437
01:58:45,280 --> 01:58:48,000
So you can bring a dictionary if English is not

438
01:58:48,000 --> 01:58:48,960
