443
01:58:59,360 --> 01:59:02,560
And that's what I don't want to allow.

444
01:59:02,560 --> 01:59:04,800
People often say, can I just put it in airplane mode?

445
01:59:04,800 --> 01:59:08,080
No, because you would just take it out of airplane mode.

446
01:59:08,080 --> 01:59:11,120
So that doesn't really solve anything.

